    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several different game modes in this Tower Defense Strategy (TD), which can be completed in one go or with endless enemies - resist countless waves of enemies for as long as possible and complete missions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the storyline to earn rich rewards, and challenge stronger enemies to earn more rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Simple, optimized, small in size but fully functional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Having dozens of different levels and a large number of tasks - no endless hard work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A huge permanent upgrade tree (over 500 different studies).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Completing hardcore tasks can lead to many achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Detailed statistical data for each run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Complete the storyline and unlock stronger challenge tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-No ads, everything can be unlocked for free!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several different game modes in this Tower Defense Strategy (TD), which can be completed in one go or with endless enemies - resist countless waves of enemies for as long as possible and complete missions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the storyline to earn rich rewards, and challenge stronger enemies to earn more rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Simple, optimized, small in size but fully functional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Having dozens of different levels and a large number of tasks - no endless hard work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A huge permanent upgrade tree (over 500 different studies).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Completing hardcore tasks can lead to many achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Detailed statistical data for each run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Complete the storyline and unlock stronger challenge tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-No ads, everything can be unlocked for free!</p>",
    "short_description": "Escape from daily life and immerse yourself in the exciting tower defense strategy game 'Little TD'. Experience a unique gaming style in 'Little Tower Defense', with various fresh game modes that are different from traditional tower defense.",
